{"resourceIdentifier":"2411","resourceName":"Bosques del Uruguay II (BDU II) Afforestation through High Quality Timber in Grasslands Project","description":"The project activity “Bosques del Uruguay II Afforestation through High Quality Timber in Grasslands Project” (hereafter, “BDU II project”) is an afforestation project on extensive cattle grazing pastures areas using exotic species (Eucalyptus grandis and dunnii) aiming to produce, as a priority product, high quality logs for sawmill industry and secondarily, biomass for energy and/or pulp.\r\nBDU II trust funds comprises 20 properties or plots located in the Central East region of Uruguay (the host country), with a total area of 14,657 ha of which, 9,363 ha are effectively planted. The unplanted area, 5,404 ha, remaining in part as natural grasslands, are used for cattle grazing and flora and fauna conservation. Given that an important portion of BDU II trust fund effectively planted area had already established plantations (8,307 ha) when the trust fund started to operate, they cannot be included within the VCS project boundary. \r\nThe BDU II project eligible for the VCS standard is circumscribed to 1,056 ha effectively planted after the trust fund operation starting date, carried out in 6 properties (5 entire plots and 29% of the 6th one). \r\nThe project activity is carried out on lightly degraded land as a consequence of many decades of intensive cattle grazing. This degradation is expected to continue in the absence of the project. \r\nThe project utilizes two species: E. grandis and E. dunnii that occupies 74% and 26% of the planted area, respectively. \r\nThe project contributes to the sustainable development of Uruguay, specifically by:\r\n•\tIncreasing labour demand from the local population\r\n•\tAdding value to wood products and diversifying the regional production will lead to higher economic revenues for the region.\r\n•\tPromoting an integrated management scheme with the ecosystem. \r\n•\tDeveloping and improving a new mechanism to finance projects in the forestry sector","location":{"latitude":-33.191454,"longitude":-54.873508},"inPublicCommentPeriod":false,"lastPublicCommentPeriod":{"startInclusive":"2025-10-14","endExclusive":"2025-11-14","endInclusive":"2025-11-13"},"attributes":[{"code":"PROJECT_ID","values":[{"type":"string","value":"2411"}]},{"code":"STATE_PROVINCE","values":[{"type":"string","value":"Florida, Lavalleja, Cerro Largo & Treinta y Tres"}]}],"participationSummaries":[{"programCode":"VCS","attributes":[{"code":"PROPONENT_NAME","values":[{"type":"string","value":"AGRO EMPRESA FORESTAL SA"},{"type":"string","value":"Montevideo, Uruguay"},{"type":"string","value":"+598 29162020"},{"type":"string","value":"dguapura@af.com.uy"}]},{"code":"PROJECT_STATUS","values":[{"type":"string","value":"Registered"},{"type":"assetSearchLink","value":null,"targetId":"2411"},{"type":"bufferSearchLink","value":null,"targetId":"2411"}]},{"code":"EST_ANNUAL_EMISSION_REDCT","values":[{"type":"string","value":"4066"}]},{"code":"TOTAL_BUFFER_POOL_CREDITS","values":[{"type":"integer","value":495}]},{"code":"PRIMARY_PROJECT_CATEGORY_NAME","values":[{"type":"string","value":"Agriculture Forestry and Other Land Use"}]},{"code":"PROJECT_SUBCATERGORY_NAMES","values":[{"type":"string","value":"ARR"}]},{"code":"PROTOCOL_NAME","values":[{"type":"string","value":"AR-ACM0003"}]},{"code":"PROJECT_ACREAGE","values":[{"type":"string","value":"1056 Hectares"}]},{"code":"VALIDATOR_NAME","values":[{"type":"string","value":"AENOR CONFIA, S.A. (UNIPERSONAL)"}]},{"code":"PROJECT_REGISTRATION_DATE","values":[{"type":"string","value":"14/10/2021"}]},{"code":"CREDIT_PERIOD_INFO","values":[{"type":"string","value":"1st, 25/03/2016 - 24/03/2076"}]}]},{"programCode":"CCB","attributes":[{"code":"PROPONENT_NAME","values":[{"type":"string","value":"AGRO EMPRESA FORESTAL SA"},{"type":"string","value":"Montevideo, Uruguay"},{"type":"string","value":"+598 29162020"},{"type":"string","value":"dgua